{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME</strong><br><strong>===============</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey into the world of Kando. Take on creatures, craft awesome weapons, help villagers and cut down tree's.\u00a0Will you slay your way to the top?\u00a0Or become a master craftsman.\u00a0It's all down to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/68682b713e3a6b73357307fc7bac1d6b.poster.avif?t=1759868330\" width=786 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/68682b713e3a6b73357307fc7bac1d6b.webm?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/68682b713e3a6b73357307fc7bac1d6b.mp4?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILLS</strong><br><strong>===============</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kando\u00a0Realm focuses not only on the combat side of the game but has a separate skill levelling system inspired by that of Old School Runescape for it's crafting and gathering. Currently we have 4 crafting and 4 gathering skills unlocked but will be adding much more as the game develops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/08fbacf7c9be8a0b5dc1de1971a7f597.poster.avif?t=1759868330\" width=786 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/08fbacf7c9be8a0b5dc1de1971a7f597.webm?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/08fbacf7c9be8a0b5dc1de1971a7f597.mp4?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLASS SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >===============</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0Kando Realm you start out as a villager and you learn the ropes about helping the people of the world of Kando.\u00a0In return you level up and get stronger until level 10.\u00a0At level 10 you can choose to study under a specific craft such as :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Warrior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Mage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Druid</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Thief</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of these classes have special abilities and class specific pros and cons including class specific quest lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/c3a6ea644226d3c66decf67ced739b17.poster.avif?t=1759868330\" width=800 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/c3a6ea644226d3c66decf67ced739b17.webm?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/c3a6ea644226d3c66decf67ced739b17.mp4?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WANT TO GET IN?</strong><br>===============<br>Simply join the discord: \u00a0to get information!<br><br><strong>CROSS PLATFORM</strong><br>================<br>Play on mobile or PC and join in on a shared world and play with people from different platforms and regions!<br><br><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong><br>==============<br>Create and customize your characters with hundreds of items and equipment from sticks to snake heads.<br><br>Themed areas and equipment allow you to be what you want. Want to be that plate armour wearing Warrior or the onesie lollipop Druid? It's up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/c070762c0735e7b174ccfff981b9cd65.poster.avif?t=1759868330\" width=800 height=586 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/c070762c0735e7b174ccfff981b9cd65.webm?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/c070762c0735e7b174ccfff981b9cd65.mp4?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OLD SCHOOL FEEL</strong><br>===============<br>2D oldschool MMORPG mechanics allow you to put your stat points into what you want and build your class the way you want!<br><br><strong>COMMUNITY</strong><br>===========<br>Join the community today in game and on Discord to see the latest news and updates going into Kando Realm (2D mmorpg).<br><br><strong>LOOT AND DUNGEONS</strong><br>===================<br>With dungeons to do and lots of loot to collect for your class and character you won't be bored anytime soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/dc01422abb2c0f5b96b9698c8f0d05ec.poster.avif?t=1759868330\" width=752 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/dc01422abb2c0f5b96b9698c8f0d05ec.webm?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/dc01422abb2c0f5b96b9698c8f0d05ec.mp4?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>PROFESSIONS</strong><br>============<br>Not interested in combat? Simply want to be a fisher, woodcutter or miner then grab your tools and come join us!<br><br><strong>CRAFTING</strong><br>=========<br>Do you have a mind for the creative? Then lets see how well you fair at crafting!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3017040?t=1759868330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/aef0054187e52e76cf8c3049d4cbb4315b03b68f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759868330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/8b042dbea7734645671102c2d6b330877f3b5021/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759868330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/8b042dbea7734645671102c2d6b330877f3b5021/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759868330","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4070310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME</strong><br><strong>===============</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey into the world of Kando. Take on creatures, craft awesome weapons, help villagers and cut down tree's.\u00a0Will you slay your way to the top?\u00a0Or become a master craftsman.\u00a0It's all down to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/68682b713e3a6b73357307fc7bac1d6b.poster.avif?t=1759868330\" width=786 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.aka