shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/c070762c0735e7b174ccfff981b9cd65.mp4?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OLD SCHOOL FEEL</strong><br>===============<br>2D oldschool MMORPG mechanics allow you to put your stat points into what you want and build your class the way you want!<br><br><strong>COMMUNITY</strong><br>===========<br>Join the community today in game and on Discord to see the latest news and updates going into Kando Realm (2D mmorpg).<br><br><strong>LOOT AND DUNGEONS</strong><br>===================<br>With dungeons to do and lots of loot to collect for your class and character you won't be bored anytime soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/dc01422abb2c0f5b96b9698c8f0d05ec.poster.avif?t=1759868330\" width=752 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/dc01422abb2c0f5b96b9698c8f0d05ec.webm?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017040/extras/dc01422abb2c0f5b96b9698c8f0d05ec.mp4?t=1759868330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>PROFESSIONS</strong><br>============<br>Not interested in combat? Simply want to be a fisher, woodcutter or miner then grab your tools and come join us!<br><br><strong>CRAFTING</strong><br>=========<br>Do you have a mind for the creative? Then lets see how well you fair at crafting!</p>","developers":["KO Studio Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https:/